{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the cat factory of Meow Factories.Inc</strong><br>In the demo of Meow Factories.Inc, you'll put your feline engineering skills to the test: build, automate, and deliver cats in a production line that's as cute as it is absurd.<br>Start from scratch and unlock your first meowchines, conveyor belts, and cat painters, while learning to assemble feline parts to fulfill increasingly complex orders.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate your first assembly line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint cats in unique colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill special orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the adorable chaos and efficiency grow<br>This demo includes the early levels of the full game and gives you a taste of your future fully automated feline empire.<br>If you love automation games with a ridiculously cute twist, hit play and put on your factory manager helmet.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842540?t=1752508012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842540/0cc1311288d42a94981bf1d553c7a0ab721dfbc8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752508012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842540/3c1645700abf59b421375cb4e762aff6970b24d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752508012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842540/3c1645700abf59b421375cb4e762aff6970b24d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752508012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the cat factory of Meow Factories.Inc</strong><br>In the demo of Meow Factories.Inc, you'll put your feline engineering skills to the test: build, automate, and deliver cats in a production line that's as cute as it is absurd.<br>Start from scratch and unlock your first meowchines, conveyor belts, and cat painters, while learning to assemble feline parts to fulfill increasingly complex orders.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate your first assembly line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint cats in unique colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill special orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the adorable chaos and efficiency grow<br>This demo includes the early levels of the full game and gives you a taste of your future fully automated feline empire.<br>If you love automation games with a ridiculously cute twist, hit play and put on your factory manager helmet.</p></li></ul>","developers":["firetoast"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3820440","name":"Meow Factories.Inc"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842540/b60378931ba96e07f17c32d365630cbd8be12ae1/header.jpg?t=1752508012","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168702,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168702/movie480.mp4?t=1752507984","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168702/movie_max.mp4?t=1752507984"},"name":"Meow Factories.Inc","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168702/6d727ea905437be073bdf1177b48cdb9ad87a5d7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752507984","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168702/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752507984","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168702/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752507984"}}],"name":"Meow Factories.Inc Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong